{"id":"96e9df1753e6aa56","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Monolithic Space","display":"df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space — ZFC Topo9 Monolithic Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space — ZFC Topo9 Monolithic Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space — ZFC Topo9 Monolithic Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"428ac3d9c9f8fa2f\" href=\"?note=428ac3d9c9f8fa2f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Weight}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Weight}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (weight graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"428ac3d9c9f8fa2f\" href=\"?note=428ac3d9c9f8fa2f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9MonolithicSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9MonolithicSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}monolithic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9MonolithicSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists C\\subseteq X\\;\\exists\\tau_C,\\mu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Weight}_S(\\mu,C,\\tau_C)\n\\land\\mu\\leq|A|+\\omega\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}monolithic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9MonolithicSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists C\\subseteq X\\;\\exists\\tau_C,\\mu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Weight}_S(\\mu,C,\\tau_C)\n\\land\\mu\\leq|A|+\\omega\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every subset has closure of weight at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|+\\omega\">\\(|A|+\\omega\\)</span>, computed in an explicitly set-coded induced subspace topology.  The weight source is a three-place graph predicate, so its cardinal value is bound as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> rather than treating the predicate itself as a number.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md","status":"resolved","id":"428ac3d9c9f8fa2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md","status":"resolved","id":"428ac3d9c9f8fa2f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Weight}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (weight graph predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-weight.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Weight}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9MonolithicSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}monolithic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9MonolithicSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists C\\subseteq X\\;\\exists\\tau_C,\\mu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\\\\n&\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Weight}_S(\\mu,C,\\tau_C)\n\\land\\mu\\leq|A|+\\omega\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"|A|+\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1703,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3734","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-monolithic-space]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","428ac3d9c9f8fa2f","9ac97ecaeb21258a","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}